---
const ua = (Astro.request.headers.get("user-agent") || "").toLowerCase();
const isCurl = ua.includes("curl") || ua.includes("wget") || ua.includes("httpie");
---

{ isCurl ? (
  <pre style="font-family:monospace;padding:20px;font-size:14px;">
{`🔐 CLASSIFIED — ACCESS GRANTED
═══════════════════════════════════════

You found the secret. Not many people run 'cat .secret'
on a 404 page and then actually try curl-ing the path.

Here's what you've earned:

1. The developer thinks pineapple belongs on pizza.
   (This is a hill he will die on.)

2. Hidden pages on this site:
   /pgp    — PGP public key
   /now    — What I'm working on right now  
   /writing — The blog nobody reads

3. Try the Konami code anywhere on the site.
   (↑↑↓↓←→←→BA)

4. Open the browser console. There's ASCII art.

That's all the secrets. For now.
— Venkat`}
  </pre>
) : (
  <html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>.secret — Classified | Venkat Sundaraneedi</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root { --white: #ffffff; --black: #000000; --yellow: #fde047; --red: #fca5a5; --green: #86efac; --purple: #d8b4fe; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { background: var(--white); font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
      .doc { max-width: 580px; width: 100%; background: var(--white); border: 3px solid var(--black); border-radius: 8px; filter: drop-shadow(7px 7px 0 rgba(0,0,0,1)); overflow: hidden; }
      .doc-header { background: var(--red); padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--black); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
      .doc-header .stamp { border: 3px solid var(--black); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 12px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; background: var(--yellow); transform: rotate(-12deg); }
      .doc-body { padding: 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .doc-body .redacted { background: var(--black); color: var(--black); padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 3px; user-select: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
      .doc-body .redacted:hover { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black); }
      .doc-body h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .doc-body ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 12px 0; }
      .doc-body li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .doc-body .code { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; font-weight: 700; background: var(--yellow); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 13px; }
      .doc-footer { padding: 16px 20px; border-top: 3px solid var(--black); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
      a { color: var(--black); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="doc">
      <div class="doc-header">
        <div class="stamp">🔐 CLASSIFIED</div>
        <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;">/// TOP SECRET ///</div>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-body">
        <h1>You weren't supposed to find this.</h1>
        <p>
          But since you did — welcome. You're the kind of person who types
          <span class="code">cat .secret</span> on a 404 page and then
          <em>actually</em> tries <span class="code">/.secret</span> in the URL bar.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px;">Here's what you've <span class="redacted">earned</span>:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The developer thinks <span class="redacted">pineapple</span> belongs on pizza. This is a hill he will die on.</li>
          <li>Hidden pages: <span class="code">/pgp</span>, <span class="code">/now</span>, <span class="code">/writing</span></li>
          <li>Try the <span class="redacted">Konami code</span> anywhere. (↑↑↓↓←→←→BA)</li>
          <li>Open the browser console. There's ASCII art. Really.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">That's all the secrets. <span class="redacted">For now.</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;opacity:0.6;">— CLASSIFICATION: EYES ONLY —</p>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-footer">
        <span>FILE: .secret</span>
        <a href="/">← cd ~ (go home)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
  </html>
)}
